# Vercel CLI project link. Machine-local.
.vercel

# Secrets. `.env*` is deliberately broad — anything new starts ignored — with
# two files exempted because they carry no secret: .env.example is a shape, and
# .env.production holds only values that ship in the browser bundle anyway.
# Nothing secret may join them. The CLI added the bare `.env*` on 2026-09-02;
# the exemptions keep it from contradicting that deliberate commit.
.env*
!.env.example
!.env.production
